WEBVTT

00:09:29.139 --> 00:09:32.355
is something that we share
with other animals.

00:09:32.379 --> 00:09:35.380
And that's related to that whole
body channel of synchronization

00:09:35.404 --> 00:09:37.124
that underlies empathy,

00:09:37.148 --> 00:09:40.251
and that is universal
in the mammals, basically.

00:09:40.275 --> 00:09:43.386
We also study more complex expressions --
This is consolation.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.510
This is a male chimpanzee
who has lost a fight and he's screaming,

00:09:46.534 --> 00:09:49.245
and a juvenile comes over
and puts an arm around him

00:09:49.269 --> 00:09:50.434
and calms him down.

00:09:50.458 --> 00:09:51.632
That's consolation.

00:09:51.656 --> 00:09:53.520
It's very similar to human consolation.

00:09:53.544 --> 00:09:55.703
And consolation behavior --

00:09:55.727 --> 00:09:56.877
(Laughter)

00:09:56.901 --> 00:09:58.586
it's empathy driven.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.427
Actually, the way to study
empathy in human children